      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chinese agriculture" is the subject of the question, representing a specific geographic region and agricultural practices."</data>
      <data key="d2">715f5a401e83bc6bbd5f502a42378d1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOIL ORGANIC CARBON SEQUESTRATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Soil Organic Carbon Sequestration refers to the process of increasing the amount of soil organic carbon. This is a key goal of fertilizer management practices and is being investigated as a specific environmental factor. The biocar application primarily influences soil organic carbon sequestration, which is the primary outcome being measured.</data>
      <data key="d2">24e771cb9389a57438330b1acd1f3294,4c4d4d735b12232890081f6bb215a34d,6095bc66a3d389dbd488017dc2ec6962,715f5a401e83bc6bbd5f502a42378d1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECONOMIC RETURN&quot;">
