      <data key="d1">"economic return" is a specific factor being investigated."</data>
      <data key="d2">715f5a401e83bc6bbd5f502a42378d1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;W&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"WARMING"</data>
      <data key="d1">"warming" is a global change factor that affects soil microbial diversity."</data>
      <data key="d2">18315f6f0efd4e7db2f5494c2fe9f410</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IPCC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) is an organization that assesses climate change science. Furthermore, the IPCC provides the EF value of 1.0% for agricultural soils.</data>
      <data key="d2">71c0fda67566eeea7889208475102b2b,b7140a24d3174f5132539645c9d54d87</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOIL CARBON STORAGE&quot;">
