    <node id="&quot;GRASSLANDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">Grasslands are a specific type of ecosystem characterized by dominance by grasses and other herbaceous plants. These areas are recognized for their impact on carbon storage and are also subject to investigations regarding the effects of grazing.</data>
      <data key="d2">33b599f788dfcbca727a5db979017f62,489357f7d77d21e208a06c332667b572,6dbe9bfac37c5a9a248dc0cd8e63d67f</data>
