    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CATCHMENT SCALE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">The Catchment Scale refers to the geographical area where water flows into a common outlet, such as a river or lake. It defines the area of land that drains to a common outlet.</data>
