    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COVER CROPS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Cover crops are a key factor in increasing soil organic carbon. They are also a CSA (Cover Seeding and Addition) practice utilized to improve soil carbon sequestration.</data>
      <data key="d2">a16b2df06f38387a7858c4ce441036c5,c241844e30fc05b93ea07be77ae71143</data>
    </node>
