    <node id="&quot;SOIL ORGANIC CARBON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Soil Organic Carbon (SOC) is a key metric for assessing soil health. It refers to the organic matter present in soil and is a central focus of research. Soil organic carbon is a key component of soil health and fertility.</data>
      <data key="d2">4c748894d4bdf8793fb7aba4cfaa5017,7462fd7b4621cabc6c52ab465dcec268,96f967df08626506f57f19ca01d158d8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NITROGEN STOCKS&quot;">
