      <data key="d1">Warming refers to the experimental manipulation of temperature. It represents the key environmental factor investigated and encompasses experimental warming treatments used to investigate the responses of extracellular enzyme activities (EEA). Furthermore, warming is defined as an increase in temperature, which is a key factor influencing soil greenhouse gas fluxes.</data>
