      <data key="d1">"The text highlights that changes in mean annual temperature (MAT) and edaphic factors (especially soil pH, bulk density and organic carbon content) rather than mean annual precipitation drive the changes in soil microbial diversity.""Multiple Global Change Factors are the factors driving the changes in soil microbial diversity."</data>
