    <node id="&quot;POULTRY MANURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Poultry Manure" refers to the waste product from poultry farming, the primary focus of the study.""Poultry Manure" is the source of ammonia emissions that the study aims to mitigate."</data>
      <data key="d2">c6fc5221bcb65c143bca7514013f5fbe</data>
      <data key="d3">"GEO"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MITIGATION MEASURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mitigation Measures" are the strategies used to reduce ammonia emissions."</data>
      <data key="d2">c6fc5221bcb65c143bca7514013f5fbe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACID SCRUBBER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Acid Scrubber" is one of the recommended mitigation measures, achieving a reduction of &#8722;92.5% in ammonia emissions."</data>
      <data key="d2">c6fc5221bcb65c143bca7514013f5fbe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPOST BIOFILTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Compost Biofilter" is another recommended mitigation measure, reducing ammonia emissions by &#8722;71.9%."</data>
      <data key="d2">c6fc5221bcb65c143bca7514013f5fbe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANURE INCORPORATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Manure Incorporation" is a third recommended mitigation measure, decreasing ammonia emissions by &#8722;83.0%."</data>
      <data key="d2">c6fc5221bcb65c143bca7514013f5fbe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LCP DIET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"LCP Diet" is a dietary strategy recommended in combination with other mitigation measures."</data>
      <data key="d2">c6fc5221bcb65c143bca7514013f5fbe</data>
    </node>
